{% doc %}
  @prompt
    6:14 PMClaude responded: Build a numbered steps section on the page "Estampa tu diseño en tela.Build a numbered steps section on the page "Estampa tu diseño en tela." Use the same numbered steps or how-it-works section style used elsewhere in the Shella theme.
    Section label (small uppercase text above the steps):
    Cómo funciona
    Step 1
    Heading: Crea tu cuenta
    Text: Regístrate con tu información de contacto y tu número de identificación — cédula o NIT. Solo necesitas un correo, una contraseña y datos básicos de tu negocio.
    Step 2
    Heading: Sube tus diseños
    Text: Carga tus archivos desde tu gestor de diseños. Aceptamos PNG, JPG, PDF, AI y SVG — ya sea un diseño en rapport (que se repite en toda la tela) o un diseño a la medida de un producto específico, como una cobija o una toalla.
    Step 3
    Heading: Pide tu tela y productos
    Text: Desde tu Sutex Design Manager, selecciona la tela, elige el producto y haz tu pedido directamente. Tu diseño llega impreso y listo para producción, directo a tu puerta.
    No buttons or links in this section., vertical, not horizontal, to differentiate from the last section
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-steps-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-steps-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.label_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-steps-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.step_gap }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.steps_top_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.step_horizontal_gap }}px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: {{ block.settings.step_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.step_background_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.step_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.number_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.number_size }}px;
    min-width: {{ block.settings.number_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.number_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.number_text_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.number_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-step-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding | times: 0.6 }}px 16px;
    }

    .ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.step_horizontal_gap | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-steps-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.section_label != blank %}
      <div class="ai-steps-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.section_label }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-steps-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.step_1_heading != blank %}
        <div class="ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">1</div>
          <div class="ai-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-step-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_heading }}</h3>
            {% if block.settings.step_1_text != blank %}
              <p class="ai-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.step_2_heading != blank %}
        <div class="ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">2</div>
          <div class="ai-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-step-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_heading }}</h3>
            {% if block.settings.step_2_text != blank %}
              <p class="ai-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.step_3_heading != blank %}
        <div class="ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">3</div>
          <div class="ai-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-step-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_heading }}</h3>
            {% if block.settings.step_3_text != blank %}
              <p class="ai-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

